[Trigger]
Name	firstLight
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Pell Ashgrove has sent for the soldiers of the kingdom, master. They will come down into the hollow in three waves, and a rival keeper has taken the crater rim in the north-east.
Action	objective	1	Hold your dungeon heart until dawn, then destroy the rival keeper.
Action	objective	1	Mine the western and southern seams before the first wave.
Action	objective	1	Break all three hero waves at your heart.
Action	objective	1	After dawn, cross the lava bridge to the crater.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	westRoad
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WestRoad
Action	message	1	The west road is the way the first column will take. A crypt and an alarm would serve you well at the narrow places.
Action	reveal	1	NorthWayGate
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	goldHollow
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	GoldHollow
Action	message	1	The ash hollow holds a good purse of gold. Take it before the heroes come.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	southCave
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SouthCave
Action	message	1	A few creatures of the ash have wandered into this cave and will serve whoever feeds them.
Action	spawn	1	36	61	-1	Spider:2	Goblin:2	Rat:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lakeShore
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	LakeLedge
Action	message	1	You are on the shore of the lava lake. Heat rises from it and your creatures stand taller.
Action	gold	1	400
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	mined1
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	700
Action	message	1	The seams hold. You can afford stronger doors and heavier traps now.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	eastWatch
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	EastGateZone
Action	message	1	The east cave is the second gate of the hollow. The soldiers will arrive here after the first column has fallen.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	craterSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RivalCrater
Action	message	1	The rival keeper sees you at his bridge and calls out his pack.
Action	spawn	2	55	25	1	Troll:3	Orc:3	LavaSpawn:3	Goblin:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	waveOne
Mode	once
Cond	time	420
Action	message	1	The first wave is coming down through the north-west gate.
Action	wavecountdown	480
Action	spawn	3	15	14	1	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Elf:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	waveTwo
Mode	once
Cond	time	900
Action	message	1	The second wave has entered the hollow at the east gate.
Action	wavecountdown	450
Action	spawn	3	70	50	1	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:2	Adventurer:3	Dwarf2:3	Knight:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	dawnWarning
Mode	once
Cond	time	1500
Action	message	1	Dawn is five minutes away. Keep your heart a little longer.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	waveThree
Mode	once
Cond	time	1350
Action	message	1	The last wave is on both roads at once, from the north-west gate and the east gate.
Action	wavecountdown	0
Action	spawn	3	15	14	1	Knight:4	Elf:3	Monk:3	Dwarf2:3	Adventurer:3
Action	spawn	3	70	50	1	Knight:4	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:3	Dwarf2:3	Adventurer:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	dawn
Mode	once
Cond	time	1800
Action	message	1	Dawn has come and the waves are spent. The rival keeper is stirring in the crater: destroy him before the hollow wakes again.
Action	objective	1	Destroy the rival keeper in the north-east crater.
Action	gold	1	600
Action	spawn	2	55	25	1	Troll:4	Orc:4	LavaSpawn:3	PitDemon:3	Goblin:3
Action	timelimit	1800
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	rivalFalls
Mode	once
Cond	time	1800
Cond	creatures	2	<=	0
Action	message	1	The rival keeper is dead and his heart is cold. Cinderhollow is quiet.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	rivalHeartDown
Mode	once
Cond	time	1800
Cond	goal	1	KillAllEnemies
Action	message	1	The rival keeper is dead and his heart is cold. Cinderhollow is quiet.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	dawnClock
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	timer	dawnClock
Action	countdown	1797
Action	wavecountdown	417
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lavaBridge
Mode	once
Cond	time	1800
Action	message	1	The lava lake has sunk with the dawn and a stone causeway rises across it to the crater.
Action	terrain	55	31	55	34	bridge	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	rivalHeartFalls
Mode	once
Cond	time	1800
Cond	defeated	2
Action	message	1	The rival heart is shattered and the crater is silent. Cinderhollow is yours.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	ashWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	-1	GoldHollow	gold	<=	0
Action	message	1	The last gold of the seam is out and the rock behind it sweats mana. A spring has opened in the hollow.
Action	terrain	30	55	30	55	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
